      },
      "id": "9954cf7d-d2e9-3b8d-662c-c11fe3d2acb1"
    },
    {
      "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
      "args": {
        "text": [
          "Kanishk: Facts.\nPhones dead. Gate\nguards gone.",
          "Those things don't\nclimb stairs well."
        ],
        "avatarId": ""
      },
      "id": "910604dd-007b-b5cb-9444-878e45f6e875"
    },
    {
      "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
      "args": {
        "text": [
          "Divyansh: Zombies.\nZOMBIES. Bro, I\ntrained for this.",
          "Mentally."
        ],
        "avatarId": ""
      },
      "id": "05db57e5-141f-500b-29b0-4531b29e4878"
    },
    {
      "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
      "args": {
        "text": [
          "Garvita: The Dome.\nThe admin block\nhas the PA system",
          "and the satellite\nphone."
        ],
        "avatarId": ""
      },
      "id": "eb9e567a-00a6-2ac7-9246-00e71674b50f"
    },
    {
      "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
      "args": {
        "text": [
          "Mayank: Then we go\nto the Dome.\nTogether.",
          "Building by\nbuilding."
        ],
        "avatarId": ""
      },
      "id": "04e715b9-30cf-372d-9f36-9508a7c4d1bd"
    },
    {
      "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
      "args": {
        "text": [
          "Kanishk: First the\nQuess Mess.",
          "Food, knives, a\ndoor that locks.\nTurn by turn.",
          "I'll call the\nmoves."
        ],
        "avatarId": ""
      },
      "id": "f1621dce-5874-0f91-6bce-bf76062a9c4b"
    },
    {
      "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
      "args": {
        "text": [
          "Parag: The\navenue's a\nstraight line.",
          "My launcher loves\nstraight lines."
        ],
        "avatarId": ""
      },
      "id": "9c11d586-9168-a6a3-e22f-d519cfe589a6"
    },
    {
      "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
      "args": {
        "text": [
          "Anshuman: The\nunderpass is dark.\nDark is mine."
        ],
        "avatarId": ""
      },
      "id": "aaf98dd4-b857-4131-accb-4bd382ac234c"
    },
    {
      "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
      "args": {
        "text": [
          "Garvita: And from\nAB2 I can get us\nacross the",
          "rooftops. All the\nway."
        ],
        "avatarId": ""
      },
      "id": "69f02423-36b3-79c4-1cf8-2892bb7efc7d"
    },
    {
      "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
      "args": {
        "text": [
          "Divyansh: And\nI'll... lead. From\nthe front.",
          "Probably.\nSpiritually."
        ],
        "avatarId": ""
      },
      "id": "339a14d0-4d2c-06dc-b68d-6b61417bb3a8"
    },
    {
      "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
      "args": {
        "text": [
          "Mayank: Okay.\nNobody plays hero.",
          "Everybody comes\nback."
        ],
        "avatarId": ""
      },
      "id": "48a65006-92a2-c046-ba6c-a63029563677"
    },
